.TH VESKTOP 1 "2026-06-19" "vesktop 1.6.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vesktop \- custom Discord client with Vencord modifications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vesktop
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vesktop
is a standalone desktop application for Discord built on Electron,
bundling the Vencord client-side modification framework.
It provides a built-in plugin system, improved Wayland and Linux
support, and a custom updater independent of the official Discord client.
.PP
This package is a repack of the upstream pre-built binary release.
.SH OPTIONS
Standard Electron/Chromium flags are accepted; see
.I https://github.com/Vencord/Vesktop
for application-specific options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR discord (1)
